    if(c[x1+dx[(dir+1)%4]][y1+dy[(dir+1)%4]] == col && bk && !vis[x1+dx[(dir+1)%4]][y1+dy[(dir+1)%4]]){bk=0; f--;}
    c[x1][y1] = col; vis[x1+dx[(dir+1)%4]][y1+dy[(dir+1)%4]] = 1;
